{"dur": 28.65, "fps": 30, "segments": [{"id": "hook", "text": "Neuf ingénieurs sur dix ratent cette erreur.", "t0": 1.2, "t1": 4.035, "words": [{"w": "Neuf", "t": 1.2}, {"w": "ingénieurs", "t": 1.522}, {"w": "sur", "t": 2.231}, {"w": "dix", "t": 2.488}, {"w": "ratent", "t": 2.746}, {"w": "cette", "t": 3.197}, {"w": "erreur.", "t": 3.584}]}, {"id": "question", "text": "Regarde bien cette poutre. Tu la vois ?", "t0": 4.415, "t1": 6.899, "words": [{"w": "Regarde", "t": 4.415}, {"w": "bien", "t": 4.938}, {"w": "cette", "t": 5.265}, {"w": "poutre.", "t": 5.657}, {"w": "Tu", "t": 6.115}, {"w": "la", "t": 6.311}, {"w": "vois", "t": 6.507}, {"w": "?", "t": 6.834}]}, {"id": "reponse", "text": "Les cadres sont espacés de la même façon… du début à la fin.", "t0": 9.499, "t1": 13.079, "words": [{"w": "Les", "t": 9.499}, {"w": "cadres", "t": 9.72}, {"w": "sont", "t": 10.105}, {"w": "espacés", "t": 10.38}, {"w": "de", "t": 10.821}, {"w": "la", "t": 10.986}, {"w": "même", "t": 11.152}, {"w": "façon…", "t": 11.427}, {"w": "du", "t": 12.088}, {"w": "début", "t": 12.253}, {"w": "à", "t": 12.584}, {"w": "la", "t": 12.694}, {"w": "fin.", "t": 12.859}]}, {"id": "regle", "text": "Mais l'effort tranchant, lui, est maximal aux appuis. Là-bas, il faut serrer.", "t0": 13.459, "t1": 18.029, "words": [{"w": "Mais", "t": 13.459}, {"w": "l'effort", "t": 13.777}, {"w": "tranchant,", "t": 14.348}, {"w": "lui,", "t": 14.983}, {"w": "est", "t": 15.236}, {"w": "maximal", "t": 15.49}, {"w": "aux", "t": 15.998}, {"w": "appuis.", "t": 16.252}, {"w": "Là-bas,", "t": 16.696}, {"w": "il", "t": 17.077}, {"w": "faut", "t": 17.268}, {"w": "serrer.", "t": 17.585}]}, {"id": "civrebar", "text": "CivRebar AI calcule l'espacement, zone par zone. Automatiquement.", "t0": 18.409, "t1": 23.13, "words": [{"w": "CivRebar", "t": 18.409}, {"w": "AI", "t": 19.084}, {"w": "calcule", "t": 19.308}, {"w": "l'espacement,", "t": 19.908}, {"w": "zone", "t": 20.882}, {"w": "par", "t": 21.257}, {"w": "zone.", "t": 21.556}, {"w": "